  "historyNote": "#6577, eff 9-13-97 (from Bar 302.04); ss by #7555, eff 9-12-01; ss by #8655, eff 6-9-06; amd by #8753, eff 11-27-06; amd by #9047, eff 12-12-07; amd by #9652, eff 2-3-10; paragraphs. (d)-(f) EXPIRED: 6-26-14 pursuant to RSA 541-A:14-a, III; ss by #10653, eff 8-7-14",
